      "offset_ms": 12800,
      "payload": {
        "source": "portal"
      },
      "text": "Great, thanks! This is Maria from Universal Community Health Center \u2014 and just so you know, this call is recorded for quality. How are you doing today?",
      "type": "utterance"
    },
    {
      "actor": "agent",
      "id": "37298032-4d8c-4a68-88ae-918425f77c56",
      "offset_ms": 25100,
      "payload": {
        "source": "portal"
      },
      "text": "Good to hear, James. So \u2014 I'm calling about your Medi-Cal coverage. Can I ask you a couple quick questions?",
      "type": "utterance"
    },
    {
      "actor": "caller",
      "id": "dbdf2770-21a7-4581-9fba-50da27fc918c",
      "offset_ms": 25100,
      "payload": {
        "source": "portal"
      },
      "text": "I'm doing alright. Thank you.",
